    "text": "If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> is the chord of contact of the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn></math>, then the equation of the corresponding pair of tangents, is",
